# Lazy-Load Owners

Load these deployed copies on demand. Do not copy long procedures into always-on rules.

- Routing, authorization, and Team activation: `.agents/shared/policies/execution-routing.md`, `.agents/shared/policies/team-native-core.md`, `.agents/shared/policies/subagent-invocation.md`
- Director language, grounding, and evidence wording: `.agents/shared/policies/language-governance.md`, `.agents/shared/policies/grounding-governance.md`
- Team stations, validation, review, memory/docs, and completion: `.agents/skills/team-*/SKILL.md` and `.agents/shared/policies/workflow-orchestration.md` (operational copies also exist under `.cursor/skills/team-*`)
- Cursor adapter and capability boundary: `.agents/shared/policies/adapters/cursor-subagent-invocation.md`, `.agents/shared/platform-capability-matrix.md`
- Source/runtime surfaces: `.agents/shared/policies/references/source-runtime-surface-map.md`

Workflow entries live in `.cursor/skills/`. Shared governance references live in `.agents/shared/`. Project memory lives in `.agents/memory/`.
